## Endpoint Priorities (Build Order)

1. Public intake submit
2. Operator auth (invite + signup)
3. Operator leads list + lead detail
4. Convert lead → case
5. Case list + case detail + notes
6. Booking slots + create booking
7. Billing (checkout + webhook + status)
8. Documents pipeline
9. Webmaster usage rollups + plan sync

